      "writtenOn": "2024-06-25T02:47:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Apparently the \"Expected maxsize to be an integer or None\" generally means one is using too old a version of python3. This appears to be python3.7 and we need python3.8+. In particular this appears to be happening because `FindGclientRoot` is annotated with `@functools.lru_cache`. Unsurprisingly, this is a [fairly recent change](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/6e8c18239d9dc4da5045778d5ed87888611bf848) after most users got to python3.8.",
      "parentUuid": "fbbcac6b_3d6768e5",
      "revId": "752c8219b05932011a98d2d46785c701007b264d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
